    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Issue:</b> UPI Payment Failure – Transaction Not Completed</p>

<p><b>Problem Description:</b> A customer reports that a UPI payment was initiated but the transaction was not completed successfully.</p>

<p><b>Impact:</b> The transaction may remain pending or fail, causing customer inconvenience and uncertainty about the payment status.</p>

<p><b>Action Required:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Verify the transaction status.</li>
	<li>Identify the possible reason for the failure or delay.</li>
	<li>Coordinate with the relevant banking operations team.</li>
	<li>Confirm the final transaction status and update the issue.</li>
	<li>Communicate the resolution to the customer, if required.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Outcome:</b> The transaction status is verified, the issue is investigated, and an appropriate resolution or status update is provided.</p>

<p><b>Note:</b> This is a simulated banking operations issue created for a portfolio project. No real customer or transaction data is used.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

